WEBVTT

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:03.924
one of those prime movers,
which we should shout from the rooftops,

00:05:03.966 --> 00:05:05.551
is vaccines.

00:05:05.593 --> 00:05:06.844
Right? We doubled --

00:05:06.886 --> 00:05:08.095
(Applause)

00:05:08.137 --> 00:05:09.388
Yes, right?

00:05:10.181 --> 00:05:11.474
Thank you.

00:05:11.515 --> 00:05:13.601
I did invent vaccines,
so I appreciate that.

00:05:13.642 --> 00:05:15.144
(Laughter)

00:05:15.186 --> 00:05:21.067
I mean, for smallpox to polio,
influenza, TB and measles, and covid.

00:05:21.108 --> 00:05:24.111
I mean, if we celebrated
the eradication of smallpox

00:05:24.153 --> 00:05:26.197
the way we celebrate the moon landing,

00:05:26.238 --> 00:05:29.492
we would have a lot less vaccine hesitancy
in the world right now.